<h2 id="conclusion">Conclusion: find the flexible schedule that fits your family</h2>
<p>Flexible work schedules for parents aren't one thing. They're a set of tools. Figure out which hours you really need covered, pick the arrangement that solves that specific problem, and present it to your employer as a clear plan with a trial period. If the job you have can't bend, plenty of flexible jobs for parents can. The right schedule lets you keep building your career without missing the moments that matter at home.</p>
